===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|fr|atmosphère}}, from {{der|en|NL.|atmosphaera}}, from {{der|en|grc|ἀτμός|t=steam}} + {{m|grc|σφαῖρα|t=sphere}}; corresponding to {{affix|en|atmo-|-sphere}}.

